WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.500
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.170
Final Encode!

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.120
Aoi!

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.190
I will eat Hanoi's program!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.620
Wake up, Blue Angel!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.360
No good.  She's not responding.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.660
Playmaker, look out!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.100
I'm logging out.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.950
Aoi Zaizen is somewhere in this school.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.750
#1: She came to school today.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.590
#2: She's hiding the fact 
that she's Blue Angel.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.050
#3: Since she appeared during class, she's 
hiding somewhere people won't find her.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.660
Not here either...

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:38.710
Aoi!

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.060
Hang on, Aoi!

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.400
Please stay back!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.080
We're taking her to the exam room!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.070
I'm her brother!

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.310
No one is allowed in the exam room!

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.380
You're the one who called me?

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.920
Yes.  I found her unconscious on the roof.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.640
Thank you.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:11.750
Umm...  I don't know if I should 
ask this, but are you and Aoi...

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.850
We're just classmates.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:16.110
I see.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.780
Things are fine now.  Go home.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:19.950
Okay.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.630
Wait a second.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.360
What's your name?

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.280
Fujiki.  Yusaku Fujiki.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.710
I run Across the universe

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.880
At the speed of light

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.750
Begin Loading

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:56.480
Open the door of dreams

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.050
VRAINS spreads

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.160
Believe in myself

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.690
VRAINS continues

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:12.000
The circuit draws the future

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:16.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.670
Access!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:21.980
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.280
Link with my soul

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:27.050
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.780
Now Win the Race

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.620
Connected world

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.120
No matter when

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.490
Nothing is impossible

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:42.630
Strive for hope

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.200
And ride the wind!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.010
How's my sister doing?

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.680
She's still in a coma.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.540
Why did this happen?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.100
She has no external wounds.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.770
I think the problem is with her brain.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:25.270
Even with the latest equipment, 
we couldn't find the cause.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:29.610
Unfortunately, we don't 
know when she'll wake up.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.490
No...  Aoi...

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.160
What happened to Blue Angel?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.950
She had a Hanoi card.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.030
It contaminated her.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.780
What'll happen to her?

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:49.010
Even I don't know.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.340
How's Blue Angel now?

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.580
I heard she's out from shock.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:00.050
She looked pathetic, so she 
may never show up again.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:06.250
If Blue Angel isn't at LINK VRAINS, 
I'm retiring from LINK VRAINS.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:13.590
Zaizen, you know why we called you.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.570
You didn't tell us about your sister.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.460
That's...

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.840
But let's put that to the side.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:28.810
It's a problem that you can't control your 
family, but that's not the main issue.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.650
That's right.

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:35.680
The problem is that your 
sister had a Hanoi card.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:40.300
We found a Hanoi program in the duel records.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:44.930
Your sister was in contact 
with the Knights of Hanoi.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:53.900
If Blue Angel was secretly communicating 
with Hanoi, you betrayed our company.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.560
Can I make a statement?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.640
What is it?

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:02.240
I believe Playmaker tricked my sister.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.960
Your sister is currently unconscious.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:09.220
So we can't confirm the truth.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:14.080
We're not naïve, so we won't 
simply accept your statement.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:19.420
We must rethink your value.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.170
Be prepared for that.  Any objections?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.420
No.  None at all.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.500
What do you want to talk about?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:45.700
If it's about Playmaker, 
I don't have any info yet.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:50.900
I've checked many things, but he 
left no traces in LINK VRAINS.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:54.300
Playmaker is a skilled hacker.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.770
I need your help.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:00.070
Oh my.  Another favor?

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.150
Wow.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.600
You know what I did, right?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.420
About Aoi?

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:12.600
Why did SOL Technologies' top executives 
know that Blue Angel was your sister?

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:17.080
How did they know she was hospitalized?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.570
I don't care about that.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:24.440
I know I'm not the only one who's hired you.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:28.790
Oh?  And you still called me?

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.040
You must be out of options.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.440
I don't care what you think.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.400
I'm in a fix.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:40.130
I'll be fired after the 
next executive meeting.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.380
Oh.  And?

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.730
I don't care about myself.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.430
The problem is Aoi.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.120
Aoi still hasn't woken up.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:54.240
The only one who knows what 
happened to Aoi is Playmaker.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.820
You're right.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:02.790
But if I'm fired, they'll stop 
chasing Playmaker for awhile.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.270
If something happens to 
Aoi during that time...

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:10.240
I must solve this situation before then.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.480
I will capture Playmaker, no matter what.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.210
You're my only ally.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:24.190
Since I'm partially responsible, 
you're threatening me to help.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.570
That's right.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:31.430
I'll never forgive Playmaker for hurting Aoi!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.400
It seems it went well.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:39.370
Yes.  Now Playmaker will 
comply with our demands.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:44.840
Ignis must be eliminated from this world.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.940
Does that hurt?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.680
It's the same as killing your own child.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:57.670
I know how important it is to 
eliminate Ignis and the Cyberse.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:04.220
I broke into the hospital's data 
and checked a bunch of stuff.

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:07.950
Wow.  You hacked into the hospital records?

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:11.170
You invaded their privacy.  That's a crime.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:13.770
Hacking itself is a crime.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.720
So defiant!

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.770
Be quiet.

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.500
Did you look at her chart?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.160
Yeah.  Aoi Zaizen is in a coma.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.930
The cause is unknown.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.480
It's not a physical issue.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.710
Then it's probably a virus.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.000
Virus?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.700
You don't know?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:36.730
A computer virus that invades 
the brain and controls people.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.600
That doesn't exist.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.660
You saw it yourself.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.550
I thought the avatar just 
went out of control.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:44.910
You're wrong.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:49.070
The virus infected the duelist 
via the LINK VRAINS system.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.200
When I ate Hanoi's program, 
there was a strange taste.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:54.980
It tasted super gross.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.740
Computer virus...

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:04.980
If Hanoi is developing such a thing, that 
means a super intelligent person is on their side.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:06.090
Maybe.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.050
Can you erase that virus?

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.820
Maybe if we have a removal program.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:14.060
But only the Knights of Hanoi would have it.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.540
I doubt we can easily get it.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:28.040
Ever since Playmaker and Blue Angel's 
duel, LINK VRAINS is even more crowded.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:31.980
I'm flickering again.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.600
Let's take a break.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.570
Yeah!  Over there!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.850
This is a nice view.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:45.400
I can get a whole view of LINK VRAINS.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:50.090
Hey, you!  That's my spot!  Move!

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:52.800
What!  Which network are you with?

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.070
That avatar doesn't scare me!

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:58.080
Quiet down!  Or I'll eat you!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.360
B-Blue Angel!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.480
Film her!

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:09.430
Playmaker!  You'll pay 
for what you did to me!

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:12.080
If you're watching this, come on out!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.580
And duel me again!

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.570
She's a fake.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.300
Hanoi is at it again.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:28.030
Actually, it may be SOL Technologies.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.500
Don't go, Yusaku.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.640
This is clearly a trap.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.970
I know.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:39.740
But #1: Blue Angel hasn't 
regained consciousness.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:45.390
#2: If that's a Knight of Hanoi, 
I'll learn how to cure Blue Angel.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:49.760
#3: If that's SOL Technologies, I'll 
tell them what happened to her.

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.270
Wait a second!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.730
Don't go if you know it's a trap!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:58.460
Exactly.  Neither group 
is the type who'll listen.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.430
I have a responsibility.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:02.940
Yusaku!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.370
Into the VRAINS!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.390
Gulp!  Playmaker!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:42.710
We got the scoop, Yamamoto!

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.350
Don't say my real name!

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.310
You came, Playmaker.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:50.320
This hot dog stand is closed again?

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:54.150
Playmaker!  Blue Angel!

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:58.890
She reeks of Hanoi.  That means...

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.860
Who are you?

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.420
Huh?  She's Blue Angel, right?

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.620
I know you're not Blue Angel.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.570
What?  Really?

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.850
Oh, you already found out?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:15.800
Because I talk like an 
old lady?  I'm shocked!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:19.810
Oh well.  Sorry, but I'm 
going to capture you.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:24.050
Even though brute force isn't my style!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.760
What?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.990
I can't move!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.660
It's disappearing!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:55.610
Hey!  I think we're in big trouble!

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.360
This is bad!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:04.800
Let's get outta here!

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:22.940
What?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.910
What's happening?  Yusei's circuit is...

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:31.120
He can't log out.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.080
Hey!  What's going on?

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:37.320
The screen's out!  Just 
when it was getting good!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.290
Main monitor is off!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.660
Switching to emergency cameras!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.680
How about SOL Technologies' 
emergency cameras...

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:46.050
It worked!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.140
Yusaku?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.600
What?

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.730
All of LINK VRAINS is the trap?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.520
That's going too far!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:05.990
We're in trouble!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.520
I stayed up all night to write this program.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:11.990
I wish you'd congratulate me.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.160
Hey!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.960
That's...

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.320
Blue Angel.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.780
Don't be mad at me.

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:46.690
Only the person who hired 
me can undo that trap.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.660
What's your goal?

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.400
My name is Ghost Girl.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:57.140
I'm a money-for-hire, 
alluring, mysterious beauty.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.140
Your employer is SOL Technologies.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.840
I knew it was them.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:06.810
My employer wants to ask you something.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.020
Akira Zaizen...

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:15.020
So you're Playmaker.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:18.090
You did all this just for me.

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:21.720
I'll do anything to capture you.

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.100
My name is Akira Zaizen.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:27.430
The brother of Blue Angel who you hurt.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.130
Now I understand.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.900
Her brother seems really angry.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:36.060
What did you do to my 
sister during that duel?

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:39.880
After that duel, she's been in a coma.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:44.080
Unable to leave LINK VRAINS.

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.620
You have it all wrong.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.440
I didn't do anything.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.060
She had Hanoi's card before we dueled.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.680
Stop lying!

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.960
My sister would never align 
with the Knights of Hanoi!

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.480
It's true.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:01.440
She was infected with Hanoi's virus.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:06.600
In order to return her to normal, we must 
acquire a removal program from Hanoi.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.210
I'm not the enemy.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:11.210
Do you think those lies will work?

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.810
I will hear the truth, even if 
I must tear you limb from limb!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.350
That'll be pointless.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:18.780
Be quiet!  That's my decision!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.760
I have plenty of time to torment you!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:33.070
Hey!  I'm against violence!

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:36.440
Ignis!  My company will retrieve you!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.690
Everything you do is by force.

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:40.810
You're losing your cool.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:44.880
If you don't talk soon, your 
body will be torn apart!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.980
He really doesn't know anything!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.080
Don't patronize me!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.060
What?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.220
He's...

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.380
Revolver!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.840
Revolver?

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.220
A Knight of Hanoi!

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:28.410
Let Playmaker go.

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.180
What?

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:32.520
I'll be the one to face him.

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.490
I can't allow that!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.190
I see.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.830
You underestimate my power.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.840
Who is this guy?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:15.430
He can control the Data Storm!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:22.110
I can easily destroy LINK VRAINS.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.660
But I don't care about that.

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:30.530
I only have one objective.  Playmaker's AI.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:33.490
You think we'll just give it to you?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.390
You'll give it to me.

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:40.730
We put a computer virus into 
your sister, Blue Angel.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:42.040
What?

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.900
Only we can remove the virus.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.710
Why my sister?

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:48.940
For hostage.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.540
Hostage?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.510
It could've been anyone.

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:57.340
As long as it inflamed Playmaker's 
sense of justice and drew him out.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.480
But a no-name wouldn't be effective.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.450
That's why we used Blue Angel.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:06.050
Used Aoi?

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.060
Hand over the removal program!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.400
That'll depend on you.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:14.660
SOL Technologies' Security 
Manager, Akira Zaizen.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:19.500
Your job is to retrieve Ignis.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:29.440
If you retrieve Ignis, you'll fulfill 
your job for SOL Technologies.  But...

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:34.910
Your sister won't wake up from the 
darkness for the rest of her life.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:40.650
If Playmaker defeats me in a duel, 
I'll give you the removal program.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:45.830
No way!  Entrust my sister's future 
to people who I don't know?

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:48.020
There's only one path.

